        "original_id": "9171758b-f516-51e3-bddd-742d27d89b72",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Ezhou, Quzhou, Kaihua County, Hubei Province, Zhejiang Province, China, Annam\n- People: Trần Ích Tắc\n- Organizations: Yuan Dynasty\n\nFacts:\n- Ezhou is a prefecture-level city in eastern Hubei Province, China.\n- Quzhou is a prefecture-level city in western Zhejiang Province, People's Republic of China.\n- Kaihua County is a county under the jurisdiction of Quzhou city in Zhejiang Province, People's Republic of China.\n- After another failed Yuan Dynasty attempt to restore Trần Ích Tắc as King of Annam, Trần Ích Tắc continued to live in Ezhou, Hubei, and died on foreign soil.",
